one today.":"Zeru partekatu bat gaur guztiontzat.","Five tiny lessons, one rule at a time.":"Bost ikasgai txiki, arau bat aldi berean.","Free flight. Undo is allowed; nothing is ranked.":"Doako hegaldia. Desegin baimenduta dago; ezer ez dago sailkatuta.","{difficulty} — endless, undo allowed, unranked":"{difficulty} — amaigabea, desegin baimenduta, sailkatu gabe","gentle":"leuna","moderate":"moderatua","hard":"gogorra","Constrained goals for seasoned wings.":"Hegal onduen gol mugatuak.","Endless score chase. Share the seed \"{seed}\" to fly the same sky as friends.":"Puntuazio-jazarpen amaigabea. Partekatu \"{seed}\" hazia lagunen zeru berean hegan egiteko.","Ember Dawn":"Ember Egunsentia","High Noon":"Eguerdi handia","Violet Dusk":"Violet Ilunabarra","Starlit Drift":"Izar-argizko Deribatzea","Aurora Vale":"Egunsenti Arrosa","Mastery: {sky}":"Maisutasuna: {sky}","{sky} {n}":"{sky} {n}","First Lift":"Lehen Igogailua","Press Space, click, or tap to flap. Flap once to take off!":"Sakatu Zuriunea, egin klik edo ukitu txandakatzeko. Flap behin aireratzeko!","Flap 3 times to get a feel for lift.":"Flap 3 aldiz igogailua sentitzeko.","Hold the Line":"Eutsi Lineari","Flap gently to stay between the ribbons. Don't touch the sky or the sea!":"Flap astiro-astiro zintaren artean geratzeko. Ez ukitu zerua ez itsasoa!","Stay airborne for 6 seconds.":"Egon airean 6 segundoz.","Thread the Gate":"Haria Atea","Gates drift toward you. Pass through the glowing gap — avoid the edges.":"Ateak zurerantz doaz. Pasa distiratsuko hutsunetik — saihestu ertzak.","Pass 3 gates.":"3 ate pasa.","True Center":"Egia Zentroa","Passing near the center of a gap earns bonus points and builds a streak.":"Hutsune baten erdigunetik gertu igarotzeak bonus puntuak irabazten ditu eta marra bat sortzen du.","Pass 4 gates — aim for the middle!":"Pasa 4 ate - erdira zuzendu!","Restless Gates":"Atsedengabeko ateak","Some gates breathe up and down. Watch the rhythm, then commit.":"Ate batzuek gora eta behera hartzen dute arnasa. Ikus ezazu erritmoa, gero konprometitu.","Pass 4 moving gates.":"4 ate mugikor igaro.","Frugal Wings":"Hegaldi Frugala","Only 18 flaps to clear 8 gates. Every press counts.":"18 flap bakarrik 8 ate garbitzeko. Prentsa bakoitzak balio du.","Tailwind Sprint":"Haize lagun lasterketa","High wind, 12 gates, beat the clock for the time bonus.":"Haize handia, 12 ate, garaitu erlojuari denbora-bonua lortzeko.","Needle Threader":"Orratz-harizgailua","Tight gaps, 10 gates. Precision over speed.":"Hutsune estuak, 10 ate. Zehaztasuna abiaduraren gainetik.","Sky Marathon":"Zeru maratoia","Survive 60 seconds of restless gates.":"Bizirik irauteko ate geldiezinetatik 60 segundotan.","Perfect Line":"Lerro perfektua","Score 5 centered passes in a single run of 8 gates.":"Lortu 5 pase zentratu 8 ateetako ibilbide bakarrean.","Calm Skies":"Zeru Bareak","Breezy":"Haizetsua","Tempest":"Ekaitza","First Clearing":"Lehenengo Garbiketa","Complete any stage for the first time.":"Osatu edozein etapa lehen aldiz.","Gate Whisperer":"Ate-xuxurlaria","Finish all five lessons.":"Amaitu bost ikasgaiak.","On the Beam":"Habearen gainean","Hold a centered-pass streak of 5.":"Eutsi 5eko pase-marra zentratua.","Half the Horizon":"Horizonte erdia","Clear 20 Journey stages.":"Garbitu 20 Bidaiaren etapa.","Beyond the Vale":"Haranetik haratago","Clear all 40 Journey stages.":"Garbitu bidaiaren 40 etapa guztiak.","Seasoned Glider":"Planeatzaile ondua","Play on 7 different days (any mode, no streak required).":"Jolastu 7 egun ezberdinetan (edozein modu, ez da marrarik behar).","Daily Breadth":"Eguneko zabalera","Finish a Daily Breeze.":"Amaitu eguneroko brisa bat.","Centurion":"Zenturioia","Pass 100 gates in one run.":"100 ate pasa korrika batean.","Forty authored stages across five skies. Every tenth stage is a mastery trial.":"Bost zeruetan zehar egindako berrogei etapa. Hamargarren etapa bakoitza maisutasun proba bat da.","Stage {n}: {name}":"{n} etapa: {name}",", cleared, best {score}":", 