. Pasa distiratsuko hutsunetik. Ertz bat, zeruko sabaia edo itsasoa ukitzeak hegaldia amaitzen du.","Scoring":"Puntuazioa","Each gate: <strong>100</strong>. Near-center pass: up to <strong>+50</strong>. Consecutive centered passes build a streak worth up to <strong>+100</strong> per gate. Finish under par for a time bonus.":"Ate bakoitza: <strong>100</strong>. Erdigunetik gertu pasabidea: <strong>+50</strong> arte. Segidan zentratutako paseek ate bakoitzeko <strong>+100</strong> arteko marra bat sortzen dute. Amaitu parekoaren azpian denbora bonus bat lortzeko.","Keyboard":"Teklatua","pause":"pausatu","undo (practice)":"desegin (praktikatu)","restart":"berrabiarazi","help":"laguntza","menus work with <kbd>Tab</kbd> and <kbd>Enter</kbd>.":"menuek <kbd>Tab</kbd> eta <kbd>Enter</kbd>-ekin funtzionatzen dute.","Gamepad":"Gamepad","<kbd>A</kbd>/<kbd>Cross</kbd> flaps, <kbd>Start</kbd> pauses, shoulder buttons and D-pad navigate menus.":"<kbd>A</kbd>/<kbd>Cross</kbd> flaps, <kbd>Start</kbd> etenaldiak, sorbaldako botoiak eta D-pad nabigatzeko menuetan.","Fair play":"Joko garbia","Every round is seeded and replayable. Daily skies are identical for everyone on the same UTC day. Assists are declared with your score.":"Txanda bakoitza hazia eta errepika daiteke. Eguneroko zeruak berdinak dira guztientzat UTC egun berean. Laguntzak zure puntuazioarekin deklaratzen dira.","Display":"Pantaila","Color palette":"Kolore paleta","Default":"Lehenetsia","Deuteranopia-safe":"Deuteranopia segurua","Protanopia-safe":"Protanopia segurua","Tritanopia-safe":"Tritanopia segurua","Accessibility & controls":"Irisgarritasuna eta kontrolak","Left-handed layout":"Ezkerraldeko diseinua","Predicted flight arc (timing assist)":"Aurreikusitako hegaldi-arkua (denboratze-laguntza)","Haptics on supported devices":"Onartutako gailuetan haptics","Replay tutorial":"Erreproduzitu tutoriala","Global":"Globala","Friends":"Lagunak","This device":"Gailu hau","No scores yet — be the first breeze.":"Oraindik ez d